{"track":"python","category":"문자열·리스트","level":1,"title":"최소·최대·합","desc":"<p>숫자 리스트의 <b><code>[최솟값, 최댓값, 합계]</code></b>를 리스트로 돌려주는 <code>stats(nums)</code>를 만드세요. 리스트는 비어 있지 않아요.</p>","starter":"def stats(nums):\n    pass\n","solution":"def stats(nums):\n    return [min(nums), max(nums), sum(nums)]\n","hint":"<p><code>min()</code>, <code>max()</code>, <code>sum()</code> 내장 함수를 써 보세요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"stats([3, 1, 2])","expected":[1,3,6],"visible":true},{"call":"stats([5])","expected":[5,5,5],"visible":true},{"call":"stats([-1, -5, 0])","expected":[-5,0,-6],"visible":false},{"call":"stats([10, 20, 30, 40])","expected":[10,40,100],"visible":false}],"id":"py-041"}